#: ../../source/notebooks/17. 7a5fa2ee134245c8b5e5698c3277e5b9 Models.ipynb:9
#: Multi-Symbol
msgid "Multi-Symbol Models"
msgstr "多品种模型"

#: ../../source/notebooks/17. 0b7ddb81fdef4b29845258e3ee4293fb Models.ipynb:11
#: Multi-Symbol
msgid ""
"The models trained so far have trained a separate instance for every "
"ticker symbol. Symbols that share the same dynamics, such as stocks in a "
"single industry, can instead be modeled jointly. This approach provides a"
" single model with much more data to learn from."
msgstr ""
"到目前为止，我们训练的模型都是为每个股票代码单独训练一个实例。而对于具有相同动态特征的品种（例如同一行业的股票），"
"则可以将其联合建模。这种方法能让单个模型获得更多可供学习的数据。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/17. 5586d855c48f43dbbe901d0c2f9eb432 Models.ipynb:13
#: Multi-Symbol
msgid ""
"**PyBroker v2** supports training one model across all symbols passed to "
"`add_execution "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution>`__,"
" as shown in this notebook."
msgstr ""
"**PyBroker v2** 支持在传递给 `add_execution "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution>`__"
" 的所有品种上训练同一个模型，本文档将对此进行演示。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/17. 24a3a39015c84727a05fd28298f6c14e Models.ipynb:65
#: Multi-Symbol
msgid "Training One Model on Multiple Symbols"
msgstr "在多个品种上训练一个模型"

