" 指标，在四只芯片股上训练一个共享的 `LinearRegression <https://scikit-"
"learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.linear_model.LinearRegression.html>`__"
" 模型："

#: ../../source/notebooks/17. Models.ipynb:105 Multi-Symbol
#: f2c52bee09ca4200be63e8b99d0537ea
msgid ""
"Registering the model with ``pooled=True`` via `model "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model.model>`__"
" trains it only once per execution. When you enable this, the training "
"function replaces its single ``symbol`` argument with a tuple ``symbols``"
" and receives their combined train and test splits."
msgstr ""
"通过 `model "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model.model>`__"
" 以 ``pooled=True`` 注册模型后，该模型在每次执行中只会训练一次。启用此选项后，训练函数会用一个 ``symbols`` "
"元组替换原本单一的 ``symbol`` 参数，并接收这些品种合并后的训练集和测试集划分。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/17. 057c18cb155744f0a6aa907944ce54a0 Models.ipynb:107
#: Multi-Symbol
msgid ""
"During the strategy execution, the trained model is shared across "
"symbols. Predictions are read with `ctx.preds "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.preds>`__,"
" positions are sized with `set_target_shares "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.set_target_shares>`__,"
" and exits use `sell_all_shares "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.sell_all_shares>`__."
" After `add_execution "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution>`__,"
" we run a `walkforward "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward>`__"
" backtest:"
msgstr ""
"在策略执行过程中，已训练的模型会在各品种之间共享。使用 `ctx.preds "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.preds>`__"
" 读取预测值，使用 `set_target_shares "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.set_target_shares>`__"
" 确定仓位大小，并使用 `sell_all_shares "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.sell_all_shares>`__"
" 进行平仓。在调用 `add_execution "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution>`__"
" 之后，我们运行一次 `walkforward "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward>`__"
" 回测："
